SUMMARY:Art in Action: Marvelous Marionettes
DESCRIPTION:Pence Family Art Workshops\nUse your imagination to bring your
  favorite animal to life! Transform cardboard\, various papers\, pom poms\
 , yarn\, and more into a lively and colorful animal marionette.\n\nArt in 
 Action: Marvelous Marionettes\nSunday\, August 2\, 1-3 PM\n$5 Members\, $1
 0 Non-Members (per person\, all materials included)\n\n**How it works:**\n
 Art in Action engages kids in art projects that are fun\, creative\, and c
 ollaborative with their family members. This is a drop-in program for ages
  5-12. No registration in advance is required\, but space and supplies are
  limited to the first 25 participants and are available on a first come\, 
 first served basis.\n\nWhen you arrive\, pay with cash or card at the fron
 t desk. A parent or adult caregiver is required to stay\, but only has to 
 pay for the project for themselves if they are also doing art. Stay as lon
 g or as short as you like over the two hour period.\n\nBecome a Member sta
 rting at $70/year and save! If you join the Pence Gallery when you attend 
 this workshop\, you can enjoy Member pricing for Art in Action\, plus rece
 ive a $5 gift certificate to our gift shop as a thank you. Membership supp
 orts art for all ages and makes creative moments like this possible—jump
  in and be part of it.\n\nWe have a different Art in Action family worksho
 p every month. Learn more at [https://pencegallery.org/art-in-action/](htt
 ps://pencegallery.org/art-in-action/).\n\nThis monthly program is generous
 ly sponsored by Mary Stephens DeWall & Les DeWall.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/art-in-action/events/315685334/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260714T211011Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260714T211011Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
